        `duckdb_v2_cast_function_destroy`, also after registration.

        The cast function can only be registered on the database the factory belongs to.

        Args:
            factory: The factory to create the cast function through.
            function_: On success, receives the newly created cast function. Owned by the caller.
            err: Optional. On failure, receives an opaque info handle the caller must destroy via `duckdb_v2_error_info_destroy`.
        """
        return self._duckdb_v2_cast_function_create(factory, function_.as_unsafe_any_origin(), err.as_unsafe_any_origin())

